# Scope mapping only. The matching auth token deliberately lives outside this
# file: npm hard-fails an install when a `${VAR}` referenced here is unset, so
# committing the token line broke `npm ci` for anyone without a Cloudsmith
# account (CI included), even though nothing they build needs the private package.
#
# To install @crcl-main/onramp-kit, add this line to your *personal* ~/.npmrc
# (or set it in CI):
#
#   //npm.cloudsmith.io/circle/common-private/:_authToken=<your-cloudsmith-token>
#
# Remove all of this once the onramp kit ships to the public registry.
@crcl-main:registry=https://npm.cloudsmith.io/circle/common-private/
